    facts:[["Flown","1984"],["Operator","Latin Space Community"],["Significance","First crewed Latin flight"],["Crew","Three"],["Crew nations","Italy · Occitania · Spain"],["Portuguese role","Tracking · recovery · deputy flight direction"],["Launch system","San Marco-centered Latin system"],["Next milestone","Stella Maris construction · 1985"]],
